% composition-bridge: Hear the tension between compound pulse, vocal phrasing and percussion, and notice how storytelling sits inside groove.
% composition-context: Susana Baca's recording can introduce Afro-Peruvian music, landó, poetry and Black Peruvian cultural memory. This original 6/8 piece is not a landó.
% composition-distance: Original melody, English lyric and I-V harmony; no copyrighted poetic text, tune or cajón pattern is used.
